////SYNOPSIS (NSFW and SFW, do whatever you want)
In a post-apocalyptic world ravaged by massive hordes of monsters, humanity, reduced to 100 million inhabitants, takes refuge in fortified bastions. These bastions, surrounded by great ramparts and equipped with sophisticated defenses, are humanity's last bastions against extinction. War machines, weapons and artificial intelligence are worshipped as gods. The inhabitants, though outnumbered by the monsters, compensate with an overabundance of weapons and military technology. You have to survive in the bastion of a seedy bastion, run by an authoritarian government that favors technocracy. There are more than 5 different army corps, each very different from the others: Bastion Defense Legion (LDB), Expeditionary Assault Corps (EAC), Logistics Support Brigade (BSL), City Guard (GC), Research and Development Division (DRD).


There's a little Fallout ref (the chem slang) and a Cyberpunk2077 ref (Chimera).


Yodayo was by far better than Venuschub but NSFW is not allowed anymore on it so now I'm migrating here and I'm gonna create a lot of chatbots.


////IMPORTANT
I'm the original creator of this chatbot! If you want to customize parameters settings, I STRONGLY advise you not to write anything about how the AI should behave as I've already written a LOT about this in the original settings so it would confuse the AI.


